  "briefing": {
    "hook": "At 10:14 PM, a private aircraft arrived at Calder International Airport carrying three passengers. By 10:31 PM, airport security discovered that one of the passengers appeared never to have boarded the aircraft at all.",
    "context": "The aircraft's manifest listed four people, including a high-profile technology investor named Adrian Vale. Security footage shows three identifiable passengers leaving the aircraft, but the fourth person's seat was occupied when the aircraft departed.",
    "tension": "Adrian's passport, luggage and boarding record all exist. The problem is that the man who checked in under his name appears to have been someone else.",
    "objective": "Determine who travelled under Adrian's identity, where the real Adrian went, and why the flight records were deliberately manipulated."
  },
  "playerRules": {
    "investigationActions": 15,
    "switchCharacterIsFree": true,
    "notebookReviewIsFree": true,
    "evidenceReviewIsFree": true,
    "theoryBuildingIsFree": true,
    "accusationAvailableAtAnyTime": true,
    "externalKnowledgeRequired": false,
    "runtimeLLMRequired": false
  },
  "truth": {
    "incident": "Adrian Vale intentionally arranged for another person to travel under his identity while he left the airport through a private service route before the aircraft departed. The apparent identity theft was actually a deliberate identity swap designed to make it appear that Adrian travelled overseas.",
    "responsibleParty": "adrian",
    "whatHappened": "Adrian was involved in a high-value financial dispute and expected legal action against him the following morning. He arranged for his assistant, Noah Reed, to impersonate him during the boarding process. Adrian then left the airport through a private service route using an alternate vehicle. Noah flew under Adrian's identity carrying harmless luggage. The purpose was to create an apparently verifiable record that Adrian had left the country.",
    "motive": "To manufacture evidence that Adrian had physically left the country before a critical business deadline, while actually remaining nearby to complete a separate transaction.",
    "method": "Identity substitution, manipulated boarding information, trusted insider access, and staged luggage documentation.",
    "centralTwist": "The apparent victim of identity fraud is actually the person who orchestrated the deception.",
    "secondaryTwist": "The assistant initially appears to be the mastermind but was acting under financial pressure and believed the arrangement was legitimate.",
    "finalTruth": "Adrian never boarded the aircraft. Noah travelled under Adrian's identity. Adrian remained in the country and later used the false travel record as an alibi.",
