    "criticalFacts": [
      "The person who boarded under Adrian's identity was Noah.",
      "Adrian did not board the aircraft.",
      "Adrian intentionally arranged the identity substitution.",
      "Adrian left the original airport through a legitimate service route.",
      "The false travel record was intended to provide Adrian with a fabricated alibi.",
      "Noah believed he was performing a legitimate task for Adrian.",
      "Mila noticed the manifest anomaly but did not initially investigate.",
      "Felix processed the identity documentation but did not knowingly participate in the deception.",
      "Adrian's luggage travelling without Adrian was intentional."
